e follows a rabbit  wearing a pocket watch and falls into  Wonderland she experiences all sorts of  crazy things  there are potions that make her shrink  and others that make her grow she meets  the Mad Hatter and has a tea party with  talking animals and she becomes the  enemy of the Wicked Queen of Hearts the  whole movie is pretty random and very  peculiar Disney took it to a whole new  direction in 2010 Tim Burton is known  for directing some really dark films and  he turned Alice in Wonderland into a  really creepy movie but the sets and  costumes were gorgeous  Burton casts Johnny Depp and Helena  Bonham Carter of course but the best  change was in the truth about Wonderland  Alice had visited the magical land first  as a naive little girl but this world is  not a happy place it turns out it was  really called underworld so creepy  Maleficent Disney decided to keep up  this dark streak with their next  live-action remake and this time they  decided to tell a classic story from a  whole new point of view Sleeping Beauty  is a classic Disney princess movie it  was released in 1959 Princess Aurora is  being blessed by fairies at her  christening but Maleficent the mistress  of all evil shows up she is offended  that she wasn't invited to Aurora's  party so she decides to curse the  princess she casts a spell that will end  her life when she turned 16 and pricks  her finger one of the good fairies  changes the curse so that Aurora will  fall into a long sleep instead Aurora  gets saved by Prince Philip who defeats  Maleficent but it all seems so random  why does this lady want to cause Aurora  pain and suffering you don't go around  cursing people when they don't invite  you to things didn't you decided to fix  this plot hole in 2014 if they released  Maleficent and it is all about  Maleficent side of the story we learn  why she became evil she had been trying  to save her people the face  Cary's but the humans were cruel and  massacred them she curses Aurora in  